    # system "This game contains mature, adult content that is intended for an 18+ audience only."
    system "遊戲包含成人內容，僅供 18 歲以上觀眾使用。"

# game/script.rpy:6
translate chinese_traditional start_519bde51:

    # system "By playing this game, you agree that you are 18 years of age or older."
    system "玩此遊戲即表示您同意您已年滿 18 歲。"

# game/script.rpy:7
translate chinese_traditional start_4e8a269c:

    # system "If you are not 18 years of age or older, please exit the game now."
    system "如果您未滿 18 歲，請立即退出遊戲。"

# game/script.rpy:9
translate chinese_traditional start_d1536767:

    # system "By clicking 'I agree', you confirm that you are 18 years of age or older." nointeract
    system "點選「我同意」即表示您確認您已年滿 18 歲。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11
translate chinese_traditional start_44bdb198:

    # system "Okay then, let's get started!"
    system "好吧，讓我們開始吧！"

# game/script.rpy:20
translate chinese_traditional start_d1f798f2:

    # "I just moved to a new city to start my career as an indie game developer."
    "我剛搬到一個新城市，開始我作為獨立遊戲開發者的職業生涯。"

# game/script.rpy:21
translate chinese_traditional start_7af065ac:

    # "Until recently, I was living with my parents and working a corporate job that I hated."
    "直到最近，我還和父母住在一起，做著一份我討厭的公司工作。"

# game/script.rpy:22
translate chinese_traditional start_098d1f53:

    # "I decided to take a leap of faith and move to a new city to pursue my dream of making games."
    "我決定踏出信念的一步，搬到一個新的城市去追求我製作遊戲的夢想。"

# game/script.rpy:23
translate chinese_traditional start_516b947f:

    # "Money is tight though, so I decided to take advantage of the extra room in my apartment and find a roommate."
    "不過錢很緊張，所以我決定利用公寓多餘的房間找一個室友。"

# game/script.rpy:25
translate chinese_traditional start_cf4e5812:

    # "I put up an ad online and got a decent amount of responses, but none of them really panned out."
    "我在網路上發布了一個廣告並得到了相當多的回應，但沒有一個真正成功。"

# game/script.rpy:26
translate chinese_traditional start_c4c9f887:

    # "There was this one guy who I thought was perfect. He didn't try to haggle over rent and said he wouldn't even be home often."
    "有一個我認為是完美的人。他沒有試圖討價還價，並表示他甚至不會經常回家。"

# game/script.rpy:27
translate chinese_traditional start_a82f85af:

    # "But turns out he just wanted to use the apartment as a drug den where he could stash his weed and have his friends over all the time."
    "但事實證明，他只是想把公寓當作毒品窩點，在那裡他可以藏匿大麻，並隨時邀請他的朋友過來。"

# game/script.rpy:28
translate chinese_traditional start_2c2b7240:

    # "Another couple asked if I would be willing to join their polyamorous relationship as a third partner."
    "另一對夫婦問我是否願意加入他們的多角戀關係作為第三個伴侶。"

# game/script.rpy:29
translate chinese_traditional start_384a76d5:

    # "Of course, I declined."
    "當然，我拒絕了。"

# game/script.rpy:30
translate chinese_traditional start_6e149907:

    # "I just wanted a normal roommate that I would get along with and wouldn't cause any trouble."
    "我只是想要一個正常的室友，能和我相處，不會惹出任何麻煩。"

# game/script.rpy:31
translate chinese_traditional start_2749f60f:

    # "After a few hours and a headache, I finally found a person that looked decent."
    "經過幾個小時的頭痛之後，我終於找到了一個看起來還不錯的人。"

# game/script.rpy:33
translate chinese_traditional start_e67b695a:

    # "His name was Robin."
    "他的名字叫羅賓。"

# game/script.rpy:34
translate chinese_traditional start_0aff7e7d:

    # "Based on our conversation, I could sort of tell he was an introvert, which would be perfect since I don't want a loud roommate."
    "根據我們的談話，我可以看出他是一個內向的人，這將是完美的，因為我不想要一個吵鬧的室友。"

# game/script.rpy:35
translate chinese_traditional start_6119c686:

    # "He was also willing to move in right away."
    "他也願意立即搬進去。"

# game/script.rpy:36
translate chinese_traditional start_13af98a2:

    # "Just to be safe though, I asked him to send me a picture of himself along with ID before taking a deposit."
    "不過為了安全起見，我要求他在收取押金之前給我發一張他自己的照片和身分證。"

# game/script.rpy:38
translate chinese_traditional start_d837d04c:

    # "He sent a photo of himself and, to my surprise, he looked more like a girl than a guy."
    "他發了一張自己的照片，令我驚訝的是，他看起來更像一個女孩而不是一個男人。"

# game/script.rpy:40
translate chinese_traditional start_fd7438f2:

    # "He had curly black hair, a small, pointed face, and a soft, feminine looking body. His eyes were light blue and his lips were full and pouty."
    "他有一頭捲曲的黑髮，一張小而尖的臉，以及柔軟、女性化的身體。他的眼睛是淺藍色的，嘴唇豐滿而撅起。"

# game/script.rpy:41
translate chinese_traditional start_190f0c50:

    # "After looking at the photo, I wasn't quite sure what to think."
    "看完照片後，我不太確定該怎麼想。"

# game/script.rpy:42
translate chinese_traditional start_cf154383:

    # "He definitely didn't look like any of the other guys I interviewed, and his appearance was very ambiguous."
    "他看起來絕對不像我採訪過的其他人，而且他的外表很曖昧。"

# game/script.rpy:43
translate chinese_traditional start_30c556dc:

    # "However, it's not like I'm looking for a roommate based on their looks, and he seemed like a perfectly nice guy over our messages."
    "然而，我並不是根據長相來尋找室友的，而且從我們的資訊來看，他似乎是一個非常好的人。"

# game/script.rpy:45
translate chinese_traditional start_2fa4bf8f:

    # "Today is his move-in day."
    "今天是他搬入的日子。"

# game/script.rpy:48
translate chinese_traditional start_b3f3453c:

    # "I'm waiting outside of the apartment building for Robin to arrive."
    "我在公寓大樓外等待羅賓的到來。"

# game/script.rpy:49
translate chinese_traditional start_bce81262:

    # pro "He should be here any minute now."
    pro "他現在隨時都應該在這裡。"

# game/script.rpy:50
translate chinese_traditional start_dc56ccbb:

    # "I figured it would make a good first impression to greet him at the door and help him move his stuff in."
    "我認為在門口迎接他並幫助他搬東西會給人留下良好的第一印象。"

# game/script.rpy:52
translate chinese_traditional start_967594a5:

    # "After a few minutes, a car pulls up."
    "幾分鐘後，一輛車停了下來。"

# game/script.rpy:53
translate chinese_traditional start_d6264076:

    # pro "This must be him."
    pro "這一定是他。"

# game/script.rpy:58
translate chinese_traditional start_c30e47d8:

    # "Robin steps out of the car wearing a black cropped hoodie and shorts."
    "羅賓穿著黑色短版連帽衫和短褲從車上走出來。"

# game/script.rpy:59
translate chinese_traditional start_cdb9490f:

    # "His clothes hugged his thin figure tightly and I could see the shape of his hips and chest."
    "他的衣服緊緊地包裹著他瘦弱的身材，我可以看到他臀部和胸部的形狀。"

# game/script.rpy:60
translate chinese_traditional start_e87b5003:

    # "I felt a little nervous as he walked towards me, I've never met someone who looked like him before."
    "當他向我走來時，我感到有點緊張，我以前從未見過像他這樣的人。"

# game/script.rpy:61
translate chinese_traditional start_e976a923:

    # pro "Hey! Are you Robin?"
    pro "嘿！你是羅賓嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate chinese_traditional start_58c0639d:

    # voice voiceline1
    # robin "Yeah, h-hi."
    voice voiceline1
    robin "是的，嗨。"

# game/script.rpy:64
translate chinese_traditional start_2469f00b:

    # pro "It's nice to meet you. I'm [protagonist_name]."
    pro "很高興認識你。我是[protagonist_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:65
translate chinese_traditional start_03af5f79:

    # voice voiceline2
    # robin "It's nice to meet you too!"
    voice voiceline2
    robin "很高興認識你！"

# game/script.rpy:67
translate chinese_traditional start_072c89b2:

    # pro "Is this all the stuff you're bringing? I can help you take it inside."
    pro "這就是你帶來的所有東西嗎？我可以幫你把它搬進去。"

# game/script.rpy:69
translate chinese_traditional start_c565c459:

    # voice voiceline3
    # robin "Oh don't worry about it, I can handle it myself."
    voice voiceline3
    robin "噢，你不用擔心，我自己也能處理好。"

# game/script.rpy:71
translate chinese_traditional start_bb5869e9:

    # pro "I insist."
    pro "我堅持。"

# game/script.rpy:73
translate chinese_traditional start_70e4b7e7:

    # voice voiceline4
    # robin "Oh... okay."
    voice voiceline4
    robin "哦好的。"

# game/script.rpy:76
translate chinese_traditional start_9632bdc3:

    # "He softly smiles for a moment before turning around to grab his bag."
    "他輕輕地笑了一會兒，然後轉身去抓包包。"

# game/script.rpy:77
translate chinese_traditional start_6b88c189:

    # "As he grabbed his bags, his shorts slightly slipped down."
    "當他抓起包包時，他的短褲微微滑了下來。"

# game/script.rpy:78
translate chinese_traditional start_e1341e80:

    # voice voiceline5
    # robin "I only have two boxes to bring to my room, so we can each take one if you'd like..."
    voice voiceline5
    robin "我只有兩個盒子可以帶到我的房間，所以如果你願意的話我們可以每人拿一個..."

# game/script.rpy:80
translate chinese_traditional start_c46f6f4b:

    # pro "Uh... for sure."
    pro "呃……當然。"

# game/script.rpy:81
translate chinese_traditional start_a8db3472:

    # "Even his voice is super feminine, it's almost surprising that he's actually a guy."
    "儘管他的聲音非常女性化，但令人驚訝的是他實際上是個男人。"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate chinese_traditional start_1c64b542:

    # "I pick up one of the boxes and take it inside."
    "我拿起其中一個盒子，把它放進去。"

# game/script.rpy:86
translate chinese_traditional start_2a248567:

    # pro "So Robin, where did you live before this?"
    pro "那麼羅賓，在此之前你住在哪裡？"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate chinese_traditional start_f9c909df:

    # voice voiceline6
    # robin "I lived in New York City, in an apartment."
    voice voiceline6
    robin "我住在紐約市的一間公寓裡。"

# game/script.rpy:89
translate chinese_traditional start_792e9ee2:

    # pro "New York!? Why would you ever want to leave that place!?"
    pro "紐約！為什麼想離開那個地方！"

# game/script.rpy:90
translate chinese_traditional start_0284397a:

    # voice voiceline7
    # robin "Oh, uh..."
    voice voiceline7
    robin "哦，呃..."

# game/script.rpy:93
translate chinese_traditional start_e325e108:

    # voice voiceline8
    # robin "I guess a change of pace would be the best way to describe it."
    voice voiceline8
    robin "我想節奏的變化是描述它的最佳方式。"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate chinese_traditional start_48213e3e:

    # pro "A change of pace?"
    pro "改變節奏？"

# game/script.rpy:97
translate chinese_traditional start_d0c34081:

    # voice voiceline9
    # robin "Yeah..."
    voice voiceline9
    robin "是的..."

# game/script.rpy:99
translate chinese_traditional start_43c9059f:

    # voice voiceline10
    # robin "I, um, just needed a quiet place for my career."
    voice voiceline10
    robin "我，嗯，只是需要一個安靜的地方來發展我的職業生涯。"

# game/script.rpy:101
translate chinese_traditional start_d2fc0434:

    # voice voiceline11
    # robin "Somewhere where I don't have to worry about the problems that come with a big city."
    voice voiceline11
    robin "在那裡我不必擔心大城市帶來的問題。"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate chinese_traditional start_3a775df7:

    # pro "Oh that makes sense."
    pro "哦，這是有道理的。"

# game/script.rpy:104
translate chinese_traditional start_eea1ce3b:

    # pro "I've never really lived in a big city before, so I guess I wouldn't know what it's like."
    pro "我以前從未真正在大城市生活過，所以我想我不知道大城市是什麼樣的。"

# game/script.rpy:105
translate chinese_traditional start_0b6b382d:

    # voice voiceline12
    # robin "It's not all bad, but it's definitely not for everyone."
    voice voiceline12
    robin "這並不全然是壞事，但絕對不適合所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate chinese_traditional start_420bb9ed:

    # pro "I can imagine."
    pro "我可以想像。"

# game/script.rpy:109
translate chinese_traditional start_549333f9:

    # "We set down the boxes in his room while continuing our conversation."
    "我們一邊把箱子放在他的房間裡，一邊繼續交談。"

# game/script.rpy:111
translate chinese_traditional start_0d3f177d:

    # pro "So what do you do for work?"
    pro "那你做什麼工作呢？"

# game/script.rpy:112
translate chinese_traditional start_0ee723c5:

    # voice voiceline13
    # robin "I uh..."
    voice voiceline13
    robin "我呃..."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate chinese_traditional start_efafffc3:

    # voice voiceline14
    # robin "W-work from home."
    voice voiceline14
    robin "W-在家工作。"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate chinese_traditional start_03d69cac:

    # pro "Oh that's convenient, I'm in the same sort of situation myself."
    pro "呵呵，這個方便啊，我自己也是這樣的狀況。"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate chinese_traditional start_d4d32ad5:

    # pro "I'm an indie game dev, so I basically can work from wherever I want provided I have my computer and an internet connection."
    pro "我是獨立遊戲開發者，所以只要我有電腦和網路連接，我基本上可以在任何我想要的地方工作。"

# game/script.rpy:119
translate chinese_traditional start_d8c089ef:

    # voice voiceline15
    # robin "Wow, that's so cool!"
    voice voiceline15
    robin "哇，太酷了！"

# game/script.rpy:121
translate chinese_traditional start_4f42f31f:

    # voice voiceline16
    # robin "A game developer seems like a dream job to be honest."
    voice voiceline16
    robin "老實說，遊戲開發人員似乎是一份夢想的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:123
translate chinese_traditional start_4e92ab7a:

    # pro "Eh, it's alright. Not the most stable career I could be in, but I've always wanted to make games and I finally got my opportunity to do so."
    pro "呃，沒關係。這不是我能從事的最穩定的職業，但我一直想製作遊戲，而且我終於得到了這樣做的機會。"

# game/script.rpy:124
translate chinese_traditional start_df40652f:

    # voice voiceline17
    # robin "What were you doing before this?"
    voice voiceline17
    robin "在此之前你在做什麼？"

# game/script.rpy:126
translate chinese_traditional start_c7e3aeb3:

    # pro "I was working as a software engineer for a big tech company."
    pro "我在一家大型科技公司擔任軟體工程師。"

# game/script.rpy:127
translate chinese_traditional start_ef47dfa2:

    # pro "I didn't like the corporate environment, so I decided to go indie and make my own games."
    pro "我不喜歡公司環境，所以我決定獨立製作自己的遊戲。"

# game/script.rpy:128
translate chinese_traditional start_12532baa:

    # voice voiceline18
    # robin "That's really brave of you."
    voice voiceline18
    robin "你真是勇敢。"

# game/script.rpy:130
translate chinese_traditional start_ab4f135f:

    # pro "Thanks, I guess."
    pro "謝謝，我想。"

# game/script.rpy:132
translate chinese_traditional start_a8ce8053:

    # "We finished unpacking Robin's belongings."
    "我們完成了羅賓的物品的拆箱。"

# game/script.rpy:135
translate chinese_traditional start_d881c139:

    # voice voiceline19
    # robin "Thank you for your help [protagonist_name]."
    voice voiceline19
    robin "感謝您的幫助[protagonist_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:137
translate chinese_traditional start_155288c7:

    # voice voiceline20
    # robin "I really appreciate it, I've never really moved to a new place all on my own before so I was a little nervous."
    voice voiceline20
    robin "我真的很感激，我以前從來沒有真正獨自搬到一個新的地方，所以我有點緊張。"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate chinese_traditional start_5fefea31:

    # pro "No problem! Is there anything else you need help with?"
    pro "沒問題！您還有什麼需要幫助的嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:141
translate chinese_traditional start_f5d9e168:

    # voice voiceline21
    # robin "Um, no I think that was everything..."
    voice voiceline21
    robin "嗯，不，我認為這就是一切......"

# game/script.rpy:144
translate chinese_traditional start_5835cd3b:

    # pro "Well if you need anything, I'll be in my room."
    pro "好吧，如果你需要什麼，我會在我的房間裡。"

# game/script.rpy:145
translate chinese_traditional start_de544ff9:

    # voice voiceline22
    # robin "O-okay. I'll let you know if I do."
    voice voiceline22
    robin "哦，好吧。如果我這樣做的話我會告訴你的。"

# game/script.rpy:147
translate chinese_traditional start_a4e049ca:

    # pro "Nice meeting you Robin!"
    pro "很高興認識你羅賓！"

# game/script.rpy:148
translate chinese_traditional start_18ea6b47:

    # pro "I think we'll get along just fine."
    pro "我想我們會相處得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate chinese_traditional start_5fdc5442:

    # voice voiceline23
    # robin "Nice meeting you too!"
    voice voiceline23
    robin "認識你也很高興！"

# game/script.rpy:153
translate chinese_traditional start_bc93f35f:

    # "Robin smiled at me before I turned and walked back to my room."
    "羅賓對我微笑，然後我轉身走回我的房間。"

# game/script.rpy:155
translate chinese_traditional start_8f2a8261:

    # "I'm glad he seems like a nice person, but his appearance and demeanor really caught me off guard."
    "我很高興他看起來是個好人，但他的外表和舉止確實讓我措手不及。"

# game/script.rpy:156
translate chinese_traditional start_45e9ec9f:

    # "He also seemed weirdly vague about why he moved and his career, am I sure he's not some serial killer looking for his next victim?"
    "他對於他搬家的原因和他的職業生涯似乎也很奇怪，我確定他不是一個正在尋找下一個受害者的連環殺手嗎？"

# game/script.rpy:157
translate chinese_traditional start_e988b9e5:

    # "But then again, he seemed pretty nervous to move here so maybe he was just being awkward or shy."
    "但話又說回來，他似乎對搬到這裡感到非常緊張，所以也許他只是感到尷尬或害羞。"

# game/script.rpy:158
translate chinese_traditional start_e8ed8bb2:

    # "And he is going to be living with me for who knows how long, so it would be best for the both of us to just get along well."
    "而且他要和我住在一起不知道要多久，所以我們兩個最好相處得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:159
translate chinese_traditional start_bcd2a5c1:

    # "It's strange though. He acts like a girl and he's very pretty like one too. The way he acts is... cute. Almost like a fembo-"
    "不過這很奇怪。他的行為舉止就像一個女孩，而且他也非常漂亮。他的行為方式很……可愛。幾乎就像一個febo-"

# game/script.rpy:160
translate chinese_traditional start_805e41bc:

    # pro "Nope! No. That's inappropriate and weird to think about."
    pro "沒有！不，這樣想是不合適和奇怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:163
translate chinese_traditional start_e953eec0:

    # "I decide to get some work done for the day."
    "我決定完成今天的一些工作。"

# game/script.rpy:171
translate chinese_traditional start_ac4459be:

    # pro "Ah shit, my back..."
    pro "哎呀，我的背…"

# game/script.rpy:172
translate chinese_traditional start_2a674f6d:

    # "I've been working on my project for a few hours and it's starting to get late."
    "我已經在我的專案上工作了幾個小時，但已經開始晚了。"

# game/script.rpy:173
translate chinese_traditional start_f1559be7:

    # "Maybe I should take a break to grab some dinner."
    "也許我應該休息一下，吃點晚餐。"

# game/script.rpy:174
